[8.077, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J$ git diff | memdoor run \"review this diff in two lines\"\r\n  \u2192 starting gateway on :18799 (background)\r\n  \u2713 gateway ready\r\nThe diff changes `Add` in calc.go to `return a - b`, so it now subtracts while keeping the docum\r\nented contract (\"returns the sum\").\r\nFix\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
[8.352, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J$ git diff | memdoor run \"review this diff in two lines\"\r\n  \u2192 starting gateway on :18799 (background)\r\n  \u2713 gateway ready\r\nThe diff changes `Add` in calc.go to `return a - b`, so it now subtracts while keeping the docum\r\nented contract (\"returns the sum\").\r\nFix: restore `return a + b` \u2014 as-is, `Add(2, 3)` returns `-1`.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"]
